 almost everything is customizable, allowing every creation within your world to have a signature look! MySims™ Kingdom...embark on your own journey of discovery and exploration!\n\nEpic Storyline - King Roland needs your help to revitalize his kingdom! Join forces with the other Sims to bring it back to its former glory!\n\nFamiliar Friends - Meet Sims like King Roland. Then say hello to old friends like Ginny and Buddy who have taken on exciting new roles.\n\nTravel to Lands - Discover all the unique things to do while you help the citizens of the vast and varied lands of the kingdom!\n\nBuilding Options - Now you can build many more contraptions that will help you finish your epic quest for the King!\n\nAcceptance of EA User Agreement (terms.ea.com) & Privacy and Cookie Policy (privacy.ea.com) required to play. EA & applicable platform accounts may be required for online features (internet required). Age restrictions apply, see o.ea.com/ea/child-access & applicable platform account for details.","ProductTitle":"MySims™ Kingdom","ShortTitle":"MySims™ Kingdom","SortTitle":"MySims™ Kingdom","FriendlyTitle":null,"ShortDescription":"Explore new lands, and meet new friends in this retro re-release with updated graphics! It's all the things you loved about the first MySims™ game, but with more challenges, puzzles, and things to explore. Can you help revitalize the kingdom?","SearchTitles":[{"SearchTitleString":"MySims","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"MySims Kingdom","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"The Sims","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Life Simulation","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Cozy Games","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"},{"SearchTitleString":"Cozy Gaming","SearchTitleType":"SearchHint"}],"VoiceTitle":"MySims™ Kingdom","RenderGroupDetails":null,"ProductDisplayRanks":[],"InteractiveModelConfig":null,"Interactive3DEnabled":false,"Language":"en","Markets":["US","DZ","AR","AU","A